# {{ .Name }} 的中文语言目录 | Chinese message catalogue for {{ .Name }}
#
# 键名会被归一化为小写且查找不区分大小写，正文保留原始拼写（见框架 i18n 包）。
# Keys are normalised to lower case and lookups are case-insensitive, while message bodies keep their original
# spelling (see the framework's i18n package).
#
# 页面里出现的每一个 tr 键都必须在这份文件与 en.yaml 里同时存在：模板只写键、不写文案，
# 因此这里少一个键，那个位置就会原样显示出键名。
# Every tr key a page uses must exist in this file and in en.yaml alike: the templates carry keys and never copy, so a
# key missing here shows up as the key itself.
#
# 带 %s / %d 的取值由控制器传入（见 internal/controller 的 view 与各页面数据）；
# 语言切换不刷新整页，htmx 只把 #yd-workspace 换掉，因此键名集合在两份目录里必须严格一致。
# The %s / %d arguments come from the controller (see view and each page's data in internal/controller); a language
# switch never reloads the page — htmx swaps #yd-workspace alone — so the two catalogues must hold an identical key set.
